line-nondegenerate</a> \\sketch Lemmas <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Abilinear-gradient-orthogonal-ker\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:bilinear-gradient-orthogonal-ker\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a62696c696e6561722d6772616469656e742d6f7274686f676f6e616c2d6b6572\">17</a> and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahyperplane-eq-complement-normal-line\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hyperplane-eq-complement-normal-line\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6879706572706c616e652d65712d636f6d706c656d656e742d6e6f726d616c2d6c696e65\">17</a> give <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\ker a=\\operatorname {span}(a^\\sharp )^\\perp $\">$\\ker a=\\operatorname {span}(a^\\sharp )^\\perp $</span>; apply Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthogonal-complement-non-null-line-nondegenerate\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthogonal-complement-non-null-line-nondegenerate\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6f7274686f676f6e616c2d636f6d706c656d656e742d6e6f6e2d6e756c6c2d6c696e652d6e6f6e646567656e6572617465\">17</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:embedding-criterion-pointwise","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#cor:pseudo-riemannian-embedding-criterion","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:bilinear-gradient","title":"def:bilinear-gradient","label":"def:bilinear-gradient"},{"kind":"uses